{
  "_about": "Single source for WHAT each CI job covers. infra/scripts/ci-scope.py reads this, the crates' own Cargo.toml (the dependency graph is derived, never listed here) and the e2e jobs' image pulls in ci.yml, and decides which jobs a change needs. infra/scripts/check-ci-scope.py keeps it honest. Rule of thumb: a path nobody classified runs EVERYTHING, so a stale entry costs time, never coverage.",
  "units": {
    "lib-core": {
      "root": "lib/core",
      "packages": [
        "lib-core"
      ]
    },
    "lib-backend": {
      "root": "lib/backend",
      "packages": [
        "lib-backend"
      ]
    },
    "lib-crypto": {
      "root": "lib/crypto",
      "packages": [
        "lib-crypto"
      ]
    },
    "lib-perlengkapan": {
      "root": "lib/perlengkapan",
      "packages": [
        "lib-perlengkapan"
      ]
    },
    "lib-ui": {
      "root": "lib/ui",
      "packages": [
        "lib-ui"
      ]
    },
    "antarmuka-portal": {
      "root": "antarmuka/portal",
      "packages": [
        "portal-microfrontend"
      ]
    },
    "antarmuka-perlengkapan": {
      "root": "antarmuka/perlengkapan",
      "packages": [
        "perlengkapan-microfrontend"
      ]
    },
    "layanan-authenc": {
      "root": "layanan/authenc",
      "packages": [
        "authenc-types",
        "authenc-core",
        "authenc-crypto",
        "authenc-storage",
        "authenc-api",
        "authenc-iam-api",
        "authenc-grpc",
        "authenc-mfa",
        "authenc-federation",
        "authenc-webauthn"
      ]
    },
    "layanan-perlengkapan": {
      "root": "layanan/perlengkapan",
      "packages": [
        "layanan-perlengkapan"
      ]
    },
    "layanan-integrasi": {
      "root": "layanan/integrasi",
      "packages": [
        "layanan-integrasi"
      ]
    },
    "layanan-secreton": {
      "root": "layanan/secreton",
      "packages": [
        "secreton",
        "secreton-types",
        "secreton-core",
        "secreton-crypto",
        "secreton-storage",
        "secreton-api",
        "secreton-grpc",
        "secreton-agent",
        "secreton-cli",
        "secreton-backup",
        "secreton-health",
        "secreton-hsm",
        "secreton-replication",
        "secreton-auto-unseal",
        "secreton-k8s-operator"
      ]
    }
  },
  "matrices": {
    "clippy": {
      "_why": "`scope` controls the lint surface per crate. Backend crates lint the full graph (--all-targets --all-features). The wasm CSR frontends lint only the shipped target (--lib --bins, default = csr feature): --all-targets would compile their test/dev targets for wasm32 (which pull native tokio -> mio, which does not build on wasm) and --all-features would turn on server-side features (ssr/hydrate) that are never shipped.",
      "units": {
        "lib-core": {
          "scope": "--all-targets --all-features"
        },
        "lib-backend": {
          "scope": "--all-targets --all-features"
        },
        "lib-crypto": {
          "scope": "--all-targets --all-features"
        },
        "lib-perlengkapan": {
          "scope": "--all-targets --all-features"
        },
        "lib-ui": {
          "scope": "--all-targets --all-features"
        },
        "antarmuka-portal": {
          "targets": "wasm32-unknown-unknown",
          "extra_args": "--target wasm32-unknown-unknown",
          "scope": "--lib --bins"
        },
        "antarmuka-perlengkapan": {
          "targets": "wasm32-unknown-unknown",
          "extra_args": "--target wasm32-unknown-unknown",
          "scope": "--lib --bins"
        },
        "layanan-authenc": {
          "scope": "--all-targets --all-features"
        },
        "layanan-perlengkapan": {
          "scope": "--all-targets --all-features"
        },
        "layanan-integrasi": {
          "scope": "--all-targets --all-features"
        },
        "layanan-secreton": {
          "scope": "--all-targets --all-features"
        }
      }
    },
    "test-services": {
      "_why": "layanan-integrasi: the whole gRPC server (and its tests, including the production mTLS gate) sits behind #[cfg(feature = \"grpc\")]; without the feature it compiles to nothing and every test is silently absent. layanan-secreton: heaviest tier (PG property tests); test binaries default --test-threads to ncpus, which resource-kills the runner, so intra-binary parallelism is capped; target_args excludes the criterion benches (harness = false), which reject the forwarded --test-threads. layanan-perlengkapan: the integration:: DB suite is a HARD gate, its Postgres is started by the job.",
      "units": {
        "layanan-authenc": {
          "test_args": ""
        },
        "layanan-perlengkapan": {
          "test_args": ""
        },
        "layanan-integrasi": {
          "test_args": "--features grpc"
        },
        "layanan-secreton": {
          "target_args": "--lib --bins --tests",
          "test_args": "-- --test-threads=4"
        }
      }
    },
    "build-backend": {
      "_why": "The authenc package (layanan/authenc) is legacy/out-of-workspace; the deployable binary lives in authenc-api. The top-level `secreton` package is target-less, so `cargo build -p secreton` compiled nothing (false green); the deployable binary is secreton-api::api_server, mirroring layanan/secreton/Dockerfile.",
      "units": {
        "layanan-authenc": {
          "package": "authenc-api"
        },
        "layanan-perlengkapan": {
          "package": "layanan-perlengkapan"
        },
        "layanan-integrasi": {
          "package": "layanan-integrasi"
        },
        "layanan-secreton": {
          "package": "secreton-api",
          "extra_args": "--bin api_server --features raft-consensus"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "images": {
    "_why": "The e2e image each unit ships (docker-compose service + the tag e2e-build-images pushes). Which images an e2e job needs is read from the job's own `for img in ...; docker pull` loop in ci.yml, so this table never has to repeat that.",
    "simpel2-authenc": {
      "unit": "layanan-authenc",
      "service": "authenc"
    },
    "simpel2-secreton": {
      "unit": "layanan-secreton",
      "service": "secreton"
    },
    "simpel2-integrasi": {
      "unit": "layanan-integrasi",
      "service": "layanan-integrasi"
    },
    "simpel2-layanan-perlengkapan": {
      "unit": "layanan-perlengkapan",
      "service": "layanan-perlengkapan"
    },
    "simpel2-perlengkapan": {
      "unit": "antarmuka-perlengkapan",
      "service": "perlengkapan"
    },
    "simpel2-portal": {
      "unit": "antarmuka-portal",
      "service": "portal"
    }
  },
  "paths": {
    "_why": "Classification of paths that are NOT inside a unit's crate. Checked in this order: everything, e2e_only, no_effect; then unit ownership; anything left over is treated as `everything`.",
    "everything": [
      "Cargo.toml",
      "Cargo.lock",
      ".cargo/**",
      "rust-toolchain",
      "rust-toolchain.toml",
      ".github/actions/setup-rust/**",
      ".github/actions/detect-changes/**",
      ".github/workflows/ci.yml",
      ".github/ci-scope.json",
      "infra/scripts/ci-scope.py",
      ".github/actions/sccache-stats/**"
    ],
    "e2e_only": [
      "antarmuka/*/tests/e2e/**",
      "tests/e2e/**",
      "tests/fixtures/e2e/**",
      "docker-compose.yml",
      "docker-compose.e2e.yml",
      ".dockerignore",
      ".github/buildkitd.toml",
      "infra/nginx/**",
      "infra/scripts/ci-build-e2e-images.sh",
      "infra/scripts/secreton-ci-bootstrap.sh",
      "infra/scripts/run-e2e.sh",
      "infra/scripts/docker-build-with-retry.sh",
      "infra/scripts/init-postgres-databases.sh",
      "infra/scripts/preseed-trunk-tools.sh",
      "infra/scripts/csp-script-hashes.py"
    ],
    "no_effect": [
      "**/*.md",
      "docs/**",
      "LICENSE*",
      ".gitignore",
      ".gitattributes",
      ".editorconfig",
      ".claude/**",
      ".jules/**",
      ".openhands/**",
      ".vscode/**",
      "*.code-workspace",
      ".gitlab-ci.yml",
      ".gitleaks.toml",
      ".gitleaksignore",
      "cliff.toml",
      "deny.toml",
      ".leptosfmt.toml",
      "docker-compose.build.yml",
      "docker-compose.screenshots.yml",
      ".github/workflows/*.yml",
      ".github/*.md",
      ".github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/**",
      ".github/actions/docker-build/**",
      "infra/helm/**",
      "infra/lint/**",
      "infra/monitoring/**",
      "infra/velero/**",
      "infra/scripts/check-*",
      "tests/load/**",
      "tests/verification/**",
      "tests/performance_test_runner.rs",
      "tests/test_oidc_flow.py",
      ".github/*.yml",
      ".github/*.yaml",
      ".github/CODEOWNERS",
      ".github/agents/**",
      "infra/scripts/test_*.py",
      "infra/scripts/install-cargo-audit.sh",
      "infra/scripts/precommit-secret-scan.sh",
      "infra/scripts/retry-dependency-check.py"
    ]
  }
